      "assistant_text": "According to the [[credential-scoping]] page, the Anthropic API key is **injected into the environment of the spawned child process** \u2014 specifically, it\u0027s injected into the environment of the Ingest agent (and Query agent) immediately before that process starts. \n\nThe key detail is that the injection happens at spawn time, not inherited from or written into the Hub\u0027s own process environment. The page emphasizes that this scoping prevents a compromised Hub process from leaking the credential, since the key exists only inside the short-lived child process that actually calls the Anthropic API.",
